==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3~13.33 seconds<sup>90f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~22 seconds<sup>300f~660f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using ranged cats such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] can knockback the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies fairly easily, so your meatshields and other attackers won't get shredded. Make sure to protect your rangers with meatshields. Use any [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] units you have and [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] since the Dark enemies stack up.

